# 🛠️ KajKhoj Firebase Configuration Example
FIREBASE_API_KEY="your-api-key"
FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN="your-project-id.firebaseapp.com"
FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID="your-project-id"
FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET="your-project-id.firebasestorage.app"
FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID="your-sender-id"
FIREBASE_APP_ID="your-app-id"
FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID="your-measurement-id"

# 🌐 Firebase Realtime Database URL (Provide your custom link here)
FIREBASE_DATABASE_URL="https://your-project-id-default-rtdb.firebaseio.com"

# 📦 Required Firestore Collections:
# 1. users: Customer & Worker general accounts, status, ratings, emergency contacts
# 2. workers: Worker public profiles, skills, ratings, rates, homeLocation, walletBalance, commissionDue
# 3. workerPrivate: Worker private KYC data (NID front/back, selfie, bank/mobile info)
# 4. categories: Service categories (Plumber, Electrician, AC Tech, Day Labor, Cleaner, Painter)
# 5. areas: Geographic zones & polygons (Dhaka, Savar, Ashulia, Hemayetpur)
# 6. pricing: Pricing matrix per area × category (basePrice, minPrice, maxPrice, visitCharge, commissionRate)
# 7. jobs: Job bookings, lifecycle status, 4-digit OTP, timelines, pricing
#    - jobs/{id}/offers: Dispatched worker offers (30-second window)
#    - jobs/{id}/bids: Worker bidding for open job board
#    - jobs/{id}/messages: In-app chat messages
# 8. reviews: Job ratings (1-5 stars), feedback tags, comments
# 9. transactions: Payment transactions, platform commission, due payments, withdraws
# 10. reports: Customer/worker dispute reports and investigations
# 11. sosAlerts: Emergency alerts triggered by users with live GPS
# 12. blacklist: Banned phone numbers, NID hashes, device IDs
# 13. auditLogs: Administrative actions and audit trail
# 14. settings: Platform settings (commission rate, due limit, dispatch weights, ban thresholds)
# 15. coupons: Promotional discount codes
#
# 📍 Required Realtime Database Nodes:
# - liveLocations/{workerUid}: Fast streaming worker coordinates (lat, lng, geohash, isBusy, updatedAt)
# - jobTracking/{jobId}: Live en-route coordinates for active service (workerLat, workerLng, etaMin)
